<!-- Editorial ornaments and accidental marks. m1: a trill in brackets, <notations><level bracket="yes"/> ("[tr]", Vivaldi,
     Op. 44 No. 11 I m72); m2: in parentheses ("(tr)", Dittersdorf, Double Bass Concerto in D, flutes m55); m3: a trill
     without <level>; m4: a natural mark over B4 outside <ornaments> (Saint-Saens, Bassoon Sonata Op. 168), then a trill
     with a flat mark outside <ornaments> (Schumann, Piano Quartet Op. 47 I, cello m11); m5: a sharp mark below A4; m6: B-flat4 with a flat mark and no
     <accidental>: the flat is printed over the note only, not before it, and the next B-flat4 needs none.
     Same file in the OSMD fork (test/data) and osmd_dart (test/fixtures). -->
